    90	translating legacy C code to Rust, developers can detect previously
    91	unknown bugs and prevent introducing new bugs [16].
    92	Since manual translation is laborious and error-prone, an automatic C-to-Rust translator named C2Rust [ 46 ] has been developed
    93	in the industry. It converts C code to Rust by leveraging _Unsafe_
    94	_Rust_ [ 37 ], which allows the use of _unsafe_ language features. These
    95	features, such as dereferencing raw pointers and calling functions
